497	25	评估引擎在处理PPT课件时，使用了哪种多模态模型？其输入和输出分别是什么？	评估引擎使用通义千问-VL（qwen-vl-max）模型处理PPT课件。其输入为PPT页面截图与文本提示，输出为图文内容描述与结构分析结果。	本方案基于contract-rise-demo项目，通过最小化改动实现教学教案评估功能，重点验证多模态AI在教学质量评估中的技术可行性与效果。系统采用阿里云通义千问系列模型，包括qwen-max用于文本总结与评分生成，text-embedding-v1实现文本向量化，qwen-vl-max完成PPT课件的图文联合分析。通过构建向量化服务与评估引擎，实现教案完整性检查与语义相似度比对，并结合前端界面展示评估结果。系统支持真实文档测试与参数调优，预期验证结果包括文档处理成功率超95%、语义相似度准确率超80%、整体评分与专家评分相关性超0.7，系统响应时间低于30秒，具备良好的可扩展性与规则配置灵活性。风险方面通过API缓存、格式转换工具、专家标注数据集等手段应对。	# 教学教案评估系统 - 开发实施方案\n\n## 方案概述\n\n基于现有contract-rise-demo项目，通过最小化改动实现教学教案评估功能验证。重点验证多模态AI在教学质量评估场景下的技术可行性和效果。## 多模态模型架构方案\n\n### 1. 阿里云模型选型与应用场景\n\n#### 文本处理模型\n- **通义千问-Max (qwen-max)**: \n  - 用途：文档内容总结、教学要点提取、评分结果生成\n  - API：DashScope Chat Completions\n  - 输入：结构化文本内容\n  - 输出：总结文本、评估建议\n- **通义千问Embedding (text-embedding-v1)**:\n  - 用途：文本内容向量化、语义相似度计算\n  - API：DashScope Embeddings\n  - 输入：教案段落、课件文本、表格内容\n  - 输出：1536维向量\n\n#### 多模态理解模型\n- **通义千问-VL (qwen-vl-max)**:\n  - 用途：PPT课件的图文联合分析、布局理解\n  - API：DashScope VL Chat\n  - 输入：PPT页面截图 + 文本提示\n  - 输出：图文内容描述、结构分析\n\n### 2. 模型调用架构设计\n\n#### 2. 向量化服务实现\n```javascript\n// vectorService.js\nclass VectorService {\n  constructor(dashscopeService) {\n    this.dashScope = dashscopeService;\n  }\n  \n  async vectorizeTeachingPlan(parsedPlan) {\n    const vectorizedSections = {};\n    \n    // 向量化各个教学要素\n    for (const section of ['contentAnalysis', 'studentAnalysis', 'teachingObjectives']) {\n      if (parsedPlan[section]) {\n        vectorizedSections[section] = await this.dashScope.generateEmbedding(\n          parsedPlan[section].text\n        );\n      }\n    }\n    \n    return vectorizedSections;\n  }\n  \n  async vectorizeSlideshow(parsedSlides) {\n    const vectorizedSlides = [];\n    \n    for (const slide of parsedSlides.slides) {\n      const slideVector = await this.dashScope.generateEmbedding(slide.text);\n      vectorizedSlides.push({\n        slideNumber: slide.slideNumber,\n        text: slide.text,\n        vector: slideVector\n      });\n    }\n    \n    return vectorizedSlides;\n  }\n}\n```\n### 阶段四：评估引擎开发 (6天)\n#### 1. 规则引擎实现\n```javascript\n// assessmentEngine.js\nclass AssessmentEngine {\n  constructor(vectorService, dashScopeService) {\n    this.vectorService = vectorService;\n    this.dashScope = dashScopeService;\n  }\n  \n  async evaluate(teachingPlan, slideshow, scoringRules) {\n    const results = {\n      totalScore: 100,\n      deductions: [],\n      detailedScores: {},\n      suggestions: []\n    };\n    \n    // 执行各项检查\n    for (const rule of scoringRules.rules) {\n      const ruleResult = await this.executeRule(rule, teachingPlan, slideshow);\n      results.detailedScores[rule.ruleId] = ruleResult;\n      \n      if (ruleResult.deduction > 0) {\n        results.totalScore -= ruleResult.deduction;\n        results.deductions.push({\n          rule: rule.criteria,\n          points: ruleResult.deduction,\n          reason: ruleResult.reason\n        });\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // 生成改进建议\n    results.suggestions = await this.generateSuggestions(results.deductions);\n    \n    return results;\n  }\n  \n  async executeRule(rule, teachingPlan, slideshow) {\n    switch (rule.checkType) {\n      case 'completeness_check':\n        return await this.checkCompleteness(rule, teachingPlan);\n      case 'semantic_similarity_check':\n        return await this.checkSemanticSimilarity(rule, teachingPlan, slideshow);\n      default:\n        return { score: 0, deduction: 0, reason: 'Unknown rule type' };\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n#### 2. 完整性检查实现\n```javascript\nasync checkCompleteness(rule, teachingPlan) {\n  const requiredSections = rule.checkParameters.requiredSections;\n  const missingSections = [];\n  \n  for (const section of requiredSections) {\n    // 检查教案中是否包含必需的章节\n    const hasSection = teachingPlan.content.some(\n      block => block.type === 'heading' && block.text.includes(section)\n    );\n    \n    if (!hasSection) {\n      missingSections.push(section);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  const deduction = missingSections.length * rule.deductionPoints;\n  \n  return {\n    score: Math.max(0, 100 - deduction),\n    deduction: deduction,\n    reason: missingSections.length > 0 ? \n      `缺少必需章节: ${missingSections.join(', ')}` : '教案结构完整'\n  };\n}\n```\n### 阶段五：前端界面开发 (4天)\n\n#### 1. 创建教学评估组件\n```typescript\n// src/components/TeachingAssessment/TeachingAssessmentPage.tsx\nimport React, { useState } from 'react';\nimport { Upload, Button, Card, Progress, Typography } from 'antd';\nconst TeachingAssessmentPage: React.FC = () => {\n  const [documents, setDocuments] = useState({\n    teachingPlan: null,\n    slideshow: null,\n    benchmark: null\n  });\n  const [assessmentResult, setAssessmentResult] = useState(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\nconst handleEvaluate = async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    try {\n      const result = await teachingService.evaluate(documents);\n      setAssessmentResult(result);\n    } catch (error) {\n      message.error('评估失败: ' + error.message);\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  };\nreturn (\n    <div className="teaching-assessment">\n      <Card title="教学材料上传">\n        <DocumentUploader \n          type="teachingPlan"\n          onUpload={(file) => setDocuments({...documents, teachingPlan: file})}\n        />\n        <DocumentUploader \n          type="slideshow"\n          onUpload={(file) => setDocuments({...documents, slideshow: file})}\n        />\n      </Card>\n      \n      <Button \n        type="primary" \n        onClick={handleEvaluate}\n        loading={loading}\n        disabled={!documents.teachingPlan || !documents.slideshow}\n      >\n        开始评估\n      </Button>\n      \n      {assessmentResult && (\n        <AssessmentResultViewer result={assessmentResult} />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```\n#### 2. 结果展示组件\n```typescript\n// AssessmentResultViewer.tsx\nconst AssessmentResultViewer: React.FC<{result: AssessmentResult}> = ({ result }) => {\n  return (\n    <Card title="评估结果">\n      <div className="score-overview">\n        <Progress \n          type="circle" \n          percent={result.totalScore} \n          format={(percent) => `${percent}分`}\n        />\n      </div>\n      \n      <div className="detailed-scores">\n        {Object.entries(result.detailedScores).map(([ruleId, score]) => (\n          <div key={ruleId} className="score-item">\n            <span>{ruleId}: </span>\n            <span className={score.deduction > 0 ? 'text-red' : 'text-green'}>\n              -{score.deduction}分\n            </span>\n            <p>{score.reason}</p>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n      \n      <Card title="改进建议" className="suggestions">\n        {result.suggestions.map((suggestion, index) => (\n          <p key={index}>{suggestion}</p>\n        ))}\n      </Card>\n    </Card>\n  );\n};\n```\n### 阶段六：功能验证与调优 (3天)\n#### 1. 使用真实数据测试\n```javascript\n// 测试脚本\nasync function testWithRealDocuments() {\n  const teachingPlan = './doc/教案：1.1 宠物医生诊断岗位工作职责.docx';\n  const slideshow = './doc/课件：2.3.1头颈部临床检查.pptx';\n  const benchmark = './doc/《宠物疾病临床诊断技术》课程标准.doc';\n  \n  console.log('开始解析教案...');\n  const parsedPlan = await documentParser.parseDocx(fs.readFileSync(teachingPlan));\n  \n  console.log('开始解析课件...');\n  const parsedSlides = await documentParser.parsePptx(fs.readFileSync(slideshow));\n  \n  console.log('开始评估...');\n  const result = await assessmentEngine.evaluate(parsedPlan, parsedSlides, scoringRules);\n  \n  console.log('评估结果:', result);\n}\n```\n#### 2. 参数调优\n- **相似度阈值调整**: 根据实际效果调整语义相似度判断阈值\n- **向量化策略优化**: 测试不同的上下文拼接方式\n- **评分规则细化**: 根据测试结果调整扣分标准\n\n## 技术验证要点\n\n### 1. 文档解析准确性\n- ✅ DOCX教案结构完整提取\n- ✅ 表格数据正确解析\n- ✅ PPTX文本和图像联合分析\n- ✅ PDF大纲文档处理\n\n### 2. 向量化效果验证\n- ✅ 上下文感知向量化vs普通向量化对比\n- ✅ 表格结构化向量vs文本向量效果对比\n- ✅ 语义相似度计算准确性\n\n### 3. 评分引擎准确性\n- ✅ 完整性检查准确率\n- ✅ 语义相似度评分合理性\n- ✅ 整体评分与专家评分对比\n### 4. 系统可扩展性\n- ✅ 新增评分规则的便利性\n- ✅ 跨专业适用性验证\n- ✅ 大规模文档处理性能\n\n## 预期验证结果\n\n- **文档处理成功率**: >95%\n- **语义相似度计算准确性**: >80%\n- **整体评分与专家评分相关性**: >0.7\n- **系统响应时间**: <30秒/份教案\n- **规则配置灵活性**: 支持快速调整评分标准\n\n## 风险与应对\n\n### 技术风险\n- **API调用限制**: 实现请求缓存和重试机制\n- **文档格式兼容性**: 提供格式转换工具\n- **向量化质量**: 多种策略对比测试\n\n### 功能风险  \n- **评分准确性**: 建立专家标注数据集进行验证\n- **规则覆盖性**: 持续完善评分规则库\n- **用户接受度**: 提供详细的评分依据说明\n通过以上实施方案，可以在25天内完成一个功能完整的教学评估系统demo，验证多模态AI在教学质量评估场景下的技术可行性	{"qa_index": 2, "group_index": 0, "generated_at": "2025-09-28T16:00:44.470588", "source_length": 7530}	2025-09-28 16:00:44.495432	[-0.016509484,-0.03231644,-0.012382113,-0.108189814,-2.0925003e-05,0.043381307,0.008123018,-0.020636857,-0.043908205,0.019934325,0.034424033,-0.109594874,0.051636048,-0.011679582,-0.04232751,0.07060439,-0.09062653,0.09413919,-0.036882892,0.003205299,0.02423733,-0.030208845,-0.04671833,0.022832267,-0.07095566,0.011108776,0.041976243,0.051987313,-0.051284783,0.015104422,0.01686075,0.062876545,-0.046367064,0.0029857578,-0.0460158,-0.016772933,-0.041449346,-0.02810125,-0.021075938,0.02371043,-0.02002214,0.015982587,0.022832267,-0.02423733,-0.05549997,-0.05866136,0.04425947,0.013523727,0.01343591,-0.0034907022,-0.047772124,-0.05866136,-0.012294297,0.029506313,-0.01686075,-0.016772933,0.024061697,0.023359165,0.0027332858,0.016246036,-0.057256296,0.022481,-0.06568667,0.06041769,-0.020197773,-0.04232751,-0.024412962,-0.03740979,0.005115306,0.004895765,-0.020636857,-0.03389713,-0.018968344,0.0005570853,0.0331946,-0.038990486,0.03126264,0.027047453,0.010318428,0.014226258,0.0029418496,0.07727844,-0.023359165,0.019846508,0.006630139,0.007113129,-0.011591766,-0.024412962,0.00028951972,-0.013084644,0.027574353,0.04074681,0.0075961193,0.0086938245,-0.0067618634,0.014577524,-0.041449346,-0.031438272,-0.028803783,-0.03389713,0.014840973,-0.010142795,-0.025642391,-0.09905691,-0.009571988,0.038814854,-0.06041769,0.0003320558,-0.030033212,-0.034599666,-0.0011964985,-0.022217551,0.068145536,0.016509484,0.019143976,0.0029638037,-0.060066424,-0.040219914,0.03986865,-0.025818024,-0.015280055,-0.018002363,-0.026169289,0.009571988,-0.014753156,0.02423733,-0.0171242,0.0015367871,0.03